# Files not needed inside the Docker build context
.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
tests/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.md
*.log
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
server.js
scripts/
index.html
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local backups / compose override files — keep them out of the build context
# too. They cannot reach the image (the Dockerfile COPYs named files, never
# `. .`), so this is defense in depth. Patterns are **-prefixed because
# .dockerignore uses Go filepath.Match, where * does not cross a /.
**/*.bak
**/*.bak-*
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*.old
**/*.save
**/*~
**/.#*
**/*.swp
docker-compose.override.y*ml
compose.override.y*ml
